<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAY 2.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAY 2.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing</p>
<p>rates for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	 May 2    April 30   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  274.720     274.600     247.020   11.21 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  310.400     310.200     306.830    1.16 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  159.270     158.900     158.970    0.19 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   47.238	47.144	47.182    0.12 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  443.300     447.340     419.180    5.75 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  141.605     141.270     141.685   -0.06 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.097	16.032	16.185   -0.54 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  216.600     216.860     212.430    1.96 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.889	 1.882	 1.888    0.05 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.588	 1.581	 1.581    0.44 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  186.860     186.830     183.135    2.03 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
